{"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/httpdestinations\/httpdestination\/dropreports"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination\/dropReports","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"A report of each batch dropped without being delivered, in the order they are dropped.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations","doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination"]]},"metadata":{"title":"dropReports","externalID":"s:16HTTPDestinations15HTTPDestinationV11dropReports11AsyncQueues0E5QueueVyAA14HTTPDropReportOy7FailureQy_GGvp","modules":[{"name":"HTTPDestinations"}],"symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination.swift#L185","fileName":"HTTPDestination.swift"},"roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","text":"AsyncQueue"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations14HTTPDropReportO","text":"HTTPDropReport"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Encoding"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations12BatchEncoderP7FailureQa","text":"Failure"},{"kind":"text","text":">>"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0